    "body": "Problem: float style :checkhealth doesn't close on focus leaves.\r\n\r\nSolution: close it on BufLeave, skip when gO opens the ToC quickfix.\r\n\r\nFix #39307 ",
    "closed_at": null,
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/39312#issuecomment-4297094590 would it make sense to enhance `make_floating_popup_options` ? \r\n\r\nall these little details, logic, and test coverage, just for health, means we have to do that all over again when we want a similar UX for other features besides checkhealth.\r\n\r\nshowing windows/floats with various behavior is a rather common thing, shouldn't require custom stuff every time.",
