            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "it'd go in `open_floating_preview` (via close_events/close_preview_autocmd), not `make_floating_popup_options` that one just builds the window config.  I considered extending `close_events`, but there's one special case to handle:the quickfix window shouldn't be closed. If `close_events` allowed registering a callback, this would be straightforward.",
